Studio Lobby
A glass-fronted lobby with a revolving door, a reception desk and a long wall of
framed photographs of presenters who have all been smiling for years. A
turnstile marked STUDIO ACCESS guards the way east. A side door leads south to
the street where the presenters live. The High Road is west.

Dee, the receptionist, looks at you over a headset. 

